  <data name="About_TermsOfUse_DialogContent" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>By using this application, you agree to the following terms:  

Purpose &amp; Intended Use
This app is designed solely for lawful personal use to capture, edit, and save images on your device. Any other use, including but not limited to unauthorized surveillance, harassment, or illegal activity, is strictly prohibited.  

No Data Collection
This app does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. Temporary files may be written to system-designated locations for internal functionality, such as image previews or editing. These are managed by your operating system. 

User Responsibility
You are solely responsible for any content you create, capture, or store using this app. The developer does not monitor or access user data and is not liable for user actions.  

No Warranty
This application is provided "as is", without any warranty of any kind. The developer is not responsible for any damages, losses, or legal issues that may result from its use.</value>
    <comment>The content of the terms of use dialog on the about page.</comment>
  </data>
